          "Lead on middle-class economic security issues that resonate across the 65-35 divide: property tax fairness, school funding adequacy, healthcare cost control, and housing affordability are the material concerns of a $80K+ income suburban constituency, and positioning on these issues determines whether the 35% opposition appears economically negligent or responsive to shared concerns.",
