          "Lead with working-class economic security: at $65,066 income and 21.2% college attainment, this is a district of skilled trades workers, small business owners, and service-sector employees for whom healthcare costs, property tax fairness, and wage growth are the primary governance concerns—not abstract partisan messaging.",
