          "Lead with education and competence: SC-HD-44's 50.3% college attainment rate and $109,746 income indicate a constituency that votes on substance and results; any candidate must offer specific, detailed policy positions on public education investment, higher education affordability, and the state's role in ensuring economic opportunity for the next generation.",
          "Address healthcare access and cost as a direct economic security issue for a 44.0-year-old homeowner majority approaching peak healthcare utilization; for affluent, educated constituencies, healthcare policy is not abstract ideology but a concrete household budget line that directly affects family finances.",
