          "Lead on suburban quality-of-life governance: develop a legislative record on education funding, public safety, transportation infrastructure, and tax policy that is explicitly indexed to the $72,394 income, 35.9% college-educated, professional suburban constituency's material interests, not abstract conservative positioning.",
