          "Do not assume the demographic profile (77% white, affluent suburban, homeowner-dominant) makes this a permanently safe seat: suburbs swing—often sharply—when incumbent performance is perceived as inadequate or when a credible challenger demonstrates greater responsiveness to constituent concerns around schools, infrastructure, and fiscal management."
