          "Do not treat unopposed victory as a mandate to govern on autopilot: the absence of a challenger in 2024 does not establish that the seat is electorally safe or that constituents lack concerns about representation — it reflects the balance of recruitment and resources at that particular moment, not the durability of the current political alignment.",
