          "Lead with working-class economic security in active constituent engagement: at $63,495 median income with 15.8% college attainment, this is a constituency for whom cost-of-living increases and stagnant wages are material concerns; legislative work on property tax reform, healthcare cost transparency, and workforce development access demonstrates responsiveness to what voters actually experience.",
