          "Lead with aging homeowner economic security: at $66,419 income with a 58.4 median age, the district's core concern is whether government is protecting retirement security, managing healthcare inflation, and handling property taxes fairly — not abstract partisan positioning.",
          "Build legislative record on fiscal management and healthcare access: an incumbent who can point to specific achievements on Medicaid stability, rural hospital support, or property tax fairness builds the outcome-focused credibility this educated, older constituency demands.",
          "Maintain active constituent engagement despite lack of opposition: unopposed victory creates risk of disconnection from district concerns; regular town halls, constituent service visibility, and demonstrated responsiveness to healthcare and tax issues keep the seat secure against future challengers."
