          "Lead with economic governance for middle-class households: housing affordability for the 24.6% renter constituency, education investment that matters to college-educated parents, and job creation in professional sectors are the material issues that sustain durability in $71,505-income districts. Avoid purely symbolic conservatism; demonstrate specific legislative results on household economic security.",
          "Monitor the Black (16.42%) and Hispanic (4.35%) constituencies with direct constituent attention: at 16%+ Black population, this is a meaningful minority community whose support or withdrawal can shift a previously safe margin. Engage specifically on economic opportunity, education, and community investment rather than assuming inherited partisan loyalty.",
