          "Lead with economic delivery for working-class households: at $66,301 median income and 23.1% college attainment, this district evaluates representatives on concrete outcomes — job creation, healthcare access, cost of living pressure — not partisan rhetoric. Build a legislative record on these issues that makes the incumbent's seat defensible.",
