          "Monitor economic sensitivity in the 82% homeowner supermajority: property tax increases, healthcare cost escalation, or portfolio volatility can shift affluent older voters rapidly; regular communication on retirement security and healthcare policy is preventive constituent work, not partisan luxury.",
